# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Native Hybrid Pro shell for the staged GUI migration.

The shell owns presentation, navigation, and GUI-thread orchestration only.
Project loading and projection run in a one-shot worker; pipeline algorithms
remain behind their existing controller and emit additive typed status DTOs.
"""
